cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release."
type: software
title: "Counting all matroids on ten elements"
authors:
  - family-names: Jo
    given-names: Sunghyeon
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
repository-code: "https://github.com/ainta/matroid-count"
url: "https://github.com/ainta/matroid-count/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  Exact counting code, an algorithm note with pseudocode and correctness proofs,
  and reproducible results for all matroids on ten elements at every rank.
  The totals are 3,232,000,741,644 unlabeled matroids and
  11,727,995,799,397,397,461 labeled matroids. Software is licensed under
  GPL-3.0-only; original documentation and recorded results are licensed
  separately under CC-BY-4.0, as described in LICENSE-DOCS.md.
keywords:
  - matroids
  - enumeration
  - exact counting
  - reproducible computation
